{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "080c4bc4-c8ce-4e8a-ae30-df1c814f2cbd",
    "name": "FT-TBD 在线智能体空间开放接入",
    "description": "FT-TBD 在线智能体空间开放接入全量 HTTP 接口（不含 WebSocket）。\n\n导入：Postman → Import → 选择本文件。\n先填 baseUrl（默认 https://asdm-dt01.leansoftx.com）、email/password 或 pat，再执行 0.1/0.2 获取 token。\n实例、会话、制品等路径参数在对应请求的 Path Variables 里填写。",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_exporter_id": "55935961"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "0. 鉴权",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "0.1 账号密码登录",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (body && body.data && body.data.token) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('token', body.data.token);",
                  "}",
                  "pm.test('HTTP 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{email}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{password}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "auth",
                "login"
              ]
            },
            "description": "账号密码登录，返回 JWT。成功后脚本把 data.token 写入集合变量 token。"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "0.2 PAT 兑换 JWT",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (body && body.data && body.data.accessToken) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('token', body.data.accessToken);",
                  "}",
                  "pm.test('HTTP 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{pat}}",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/personal-access-tokens/exchange",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "auth",
                "personal-access-tokens",
                "exchange"
              ]
            },
            "description": "用 PAT 兑换 JWT。成功后脚本把 data.accessToken 写入集合变量 token。"
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "1. 实例管理",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "1.1 创建实例",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "const data = body && body.data;",
                  "const id = data && (data.instanceId || (data.instance && data.instance.instanceId));",
                  "if (id) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('instanceId', id);",
                  "}",
                  "pm.test('HTTP 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{token}}",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"workspaceId\": {{workspaceId}},\n  \"imageConfigId\": \"{{imageConfigId}}\",\n  \"cpu\": \"2\",\n  \"memory\": \"4Gi\",\n  \"idleTimeoutMinutes\": 30\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/agentorbit/workspaces",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "agentorbit",
                "workspaces"
              ]
            },
            "description": "创建（或复用）该 workspace 的在线智能体空间实例。\n\n必填：workspaceId、imageConfigId；可选：cpu、memory、idleTimeoutMinutes（0 表示永不自动暂停）。\n成功后脚本把 data.instanceId 写入集合变量 instanceId。"
          },
          "response": []
        },
